Test SGR-0 color reset

ECMA-48 states that SGR 0 "cancels the effect of any preceding occurrence
of SGR in the data stream regardless of the setting of the graphic rendition
combination mode (GRCM)".


You should see only black:SGR 30 and SGR 40 don't work:up to here
You should see only white:SGR 37 and SGR 47 don't work:up to here
You should see text here: SGR 0 reset works (explicit 0)
................and here: SGR 0 reset works (default param)
